  "extraction_notes": "Reaction Entry 5: yield 96% is the headline, 85% is from the 3 mmol scale run as specified in note (c).\nCompound 22g (from Proline): Based on the NHCHO label and the general reaction pattern, it is assumed the proline nitrogen is lost and the formamide-derived carbon completes a five-membered ring, yielding methyl 2-(formylamino)cyclopent-1-enecarboxylate.\nNote (c) scale is interpreted as 3 mmol."
